OL,3,AHusband calls for PM to intervene after
OL,4,Awife detained in Egypt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has approached the Egyptian
OL,7,Fconsulate in London for a response. The
OL,8,FForeign, Commonwealth & Development
OL,9,FOffice said it was in contact with
OL,10,Fauthorities in Egypt.
